{"chunkId": "5924580b-dd87-5275-8ce3-5a67cc112606", "text": "间隔练习：将学习分散到多个较短的时段中，以固定间隔反复回顾学习内容，而非一次性长时间突击学习，从而提升长期记忆效果。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-distributed-practice", "strategyName": "间隔练习", "chunkType": "definition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}}}
{"chunkId": "af2984d7-c341-5f1d-99d9-529e2be0f1ec", "text": "间隔练习的第 1 步：查看课程大纲，确认考试日期和需要覆盖的主题。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-distributed-practice", "strategyName": "间隔练习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 1, "totalSteps": 6}}
{"chunkId": "47884b26-46ca-561e-8e61-292d2b370126", "text": "间隔练习的第 2 步：制定间隔学习计划，将备考分散到数周内。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-distributed-practice", "strategyName": "间隔练习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 2, "totalSteps": 6}}
{"chunkId": "cd836916-2987-5298-b623-19bd804747c1", "text": "间隔练习的第 3 步：每隔固定间隔（如每隔一天或每周固定几天）安排一次较短的学习时段（约1-2小时）。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-distributed-practice", "strategyName": "间隔练习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 3, "totalSteps": 6}}
{"chunkId": "71d0cde8-f5a7-568d-ae6b-aabb93a786dc", "text": "间隔练习的第 4 步：每个时段集中攻克一部分材料，深入加工和整合概念。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-distributed-practice", "strategyName": "间隔练习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 4, "totalSteps": 6}}
{"chunkId": "bf341b63-90f6-5e6c-a481-cbad6b5d96dd", "text": "间隔练习的第 5 步：在后续时段中回顾之前学过的旧材料（建议75%时间用于新材料，25%时间用于旧材料）。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-distributed-practice", "strategyName": "间隔练习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 5, "totalSteps": 6}}
{"chunkId": "18316a11-cd23-504d-be96-4b50e3e81095", "text": "间隔练习的第 6 步：坚持执行计划，避免跳过学习时段。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-distributed-practice", "strategyName": "间隔练习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 6, "totalSteps": 6}}
{"chunkId": "7cd45726-50c5-5567-ba64-a1389ed2d53d", "text": "间隔练习适合有明确考试日期的课程学习，原因是：可以根据课程大纲提前数周规划间隔学习计划，将备考分散到考试前的多个时段中。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-distributed-practice", "strategyName": "间隔练习", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "有明确考试日期的课程学习"}}
{"chunkId": "a75838c7-bd48-504e-9cdc-945d23cf5f64", "text": "间隔练习适合需要长期记忆大量课程内容，原因是：间隔练习通过多次重温材料，将信息更有效地编码到长期记忆中，减少遗忘。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-distributed-practice", "strategyName": "间隔练习", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要长期记忆大量课程内容"}}
{"chunkId": "b3ed22d4-e1a1-5b29-af5e-8d8be6a5f3dd", "text": "间隔练习不适合考试前仅剩1-2天，原因是：间隔练习需要提前数周规划，临时无法实施有效的间隔安排。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-distributed-practice", "strategyName": "间隔练习", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "考试前仅剩1-2天"}}
{"chunkId": "7455dbfa-ad22-5d90-988f-830a55b95438", "text": "间隔练习不适合缺乏自律和学习计划能力，原因是：间隔练习要求长期坚持固定时段学习，需要较强的纪律性来避免分心和跳过学习时段。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-distributed-practice", "strategyName": "间隔练习", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.9, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.8, "overallScore": 0.73, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "缺乏自律和学习计划能力"}}
